    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On the sidelines of the UZIMA-DS study annual gathering, the Brain and Mind Institute (BMI) had the honor of hosting Dr. Gijs Walraven, Director for Health at the Aga Khan Development Network, at the Vishakani Health Facility in Kilifi County. Dr. Walraven, who also serves as the General Manager of Aga Khan Health Services, visited Vishakani Dispensary to familiarize himself with the site where BMI intends to conduct research. Discussions focused on collaborations between the County Government of Kilifi and various partners aimed at improving mental and brain health in the Kaloleni community.",
